('a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003', 'reading', 'mcq', 10, 2, 'According to the passage, what is the significance of the sea otter within North Pacific kelp ecosystems?', NULL, '[{"label": "A", "text": "It directly consumes kelp fronds, keeping canopy growth within sustainable limits."}, {"label": "B", "text": "It controls sea urchin populations, preventing the destruction of kelp habitat."}, {"label": "C", "text": "It competes with commercial fisheries for the same prey species."}, {"label": "D", "text": "It was identified by Robert Paine as the primary driver of kelp forest biodiversity."}]'::jsonb, 'B', 'mcq'),
('a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003', 'reading', 'mcq', 11, 2, 'What does the writer suggest about the kelp forests off the coast of Tasmania?', NULL, '[{"label": "A", "text": "They have made a substantial recovery since the 2011 marine heatwave."}, {"label": "B", "text": "They were already in decline before the 2011 heatwave due to urchin pressure."}, {"label": "C", "text": "They have struggled to recover because warmer baseline temperatures persist."}, {"label": "D", "text": "They represent the largest kelp forest system in the southern hemisphere."}]'::jsonb, 'C', 'mcq'),
('a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003', 'reading', 'mcq', 12, 2, 'According to the passage, what caused the collapse of the abalone fishery in California in the late 1990s?', NULL, '[{"label": "A", "text": "The reintroduction of sea otters, which competed directly with abalone for food."}, {"label": "B", "text": "A combination of excessive fishing and kelp decline linked to urchin population growth."}, {"label": "C", "text": "A marine heatwave that destroyed the kelp canopy across the California coastline."}, {"label": "D", "text": "The introduction of an invasive urchin species that displaced native abalone populations."}]'::jsonb, 'B', 'mcq'),
('a0000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003', 'reading', 'mcq', 13, 2, 'What point does the writer make about the selective breeding programme at the University of California, Santa Barbara?', NULL, '[{"label": "A", "text": "It has already restored kelp forests across several high-priority sites in California."}, {"label": "B", "text": "It has produced kelp varieties that can grow in warmer water but its large-scale impact is unproven."}, {"label": "C", "text": "It is the most cost-effective restoration approach currently available to marine ecologists."}, {"label": "D", "text": "It was developed in direct response to the Tasmanian kelp collapse of 2011."}]'::jsonb, 'B', 'mcq');
